# Reports worker (services/reports, node dist/worker.js; weekly owner summaries). Copy to env/reports-worker.env.
# Validated at startup by services/reports/src/worker/worker-env.ts. compose.yml sets everything it needs from ../.env:
# NODE_ENV=production, Supabase (with the service-role key), Redis and the core's queue prefix.
# Nothing is required here; the file exists so the worker has its own place for future settings.
